  "wikitext": "[[File:Striped Candy.png|200px|left|Striped Candy]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 17\n |halloweenhat = 10\n |time = 10m\n |source = {{Infoicon|halloweentmaker|bigger|link=Halloween Treats Maker}}\n |xp = 34\n |dia = 3\n}}\n'''Striped Candy''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 17. It's a special item used only for the Halloween 2025 event.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Striped Candies'''===\n[[File:Halloween Treats Maker.png|150px|left|Halloween Treats Maker]]\nStriped Candy are made in the [[Halloween Treats Maker]].\n\nTo make a striped candy in 2025, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Bread.png |75px|Bread|link=Bread]]\n|[[File:Soybean.png|75px|Soybean|link=Soybean]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\nIt takes 10 minutes to make a candy. Each candy gives players 34 [[experience]] points.\n\nAdditionally, Striped Candy is used to make the following [[products]]:\n{{Item Usage|Striped Candy\n|Soft Candy|1|20\n}}\n\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 candies per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat. Each candy used on a boat will be rewarded with 10 [[Halloween Hat]]s, 15 halloween hats in a 2-star and 20 halloween hats in a 3-star.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Halloween Treats Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Bread Products]]\n[[Category:Soybean Products]]\n\n\n{{Languages\n|de = Streifenbonbons\n|es = Caramelos coloridos\n}}",
